{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/peace-lagoons-peace-homes-group-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":367,"crm_id":"2092","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Peace Lagoons","slug":"peace-lagoons-peace-homes-group-dubailand","display_address":"Dubailand","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Peace Homes Group","price":638000,"display_price":"638K","lattitude":25.0981526,"longitude":55.3774218,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Peace lagoons is a premium residential complex from the developer Peace Homes Group. Located in the developed area of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand</a>, Dubai. The building consists of 17 residential floors and a 3-storey podium. The complex is a unique architectural masterpiece that subtly fits into the urban landscape, offering modern comfort and elegance.</p><p>Elegant studios and spacious <strong>1 and 2 bedroom apartments</strong> with gorgeous panoramic views and private pools are available for sale. The interiors are premium and made using modern design solutions.</p><p>Residents have access to a variety of world-class amenities, including a gym with a crossfit track, a full-fledged SPA center with a sauna and steam room, as well as recreational facilities such as mini golf, bowling and a cinema. There is an infinity pool and a barbecue area inside the complex. On the territory there is a landscaped garden and parks for a relaxing and relaxing holiday.</p><p>It is conveniently located next to the Dubai-Al Ain Road and provides seamless connections to key Dubai locations including the Dubai Outlet Mall, Dubai Silicon Oasis and IMG World of Adventure. Img Worlds Of Adventure is just 5 minutes away, and Silicon Oasis, Dubai Outlet Mall, Dubai Mall and the famous Dubai Miracle Garden and Dubai Butterfly Garden parks are located within a 10-15-minute radius. Dubai International Airport is a 25-minute drive away.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/peace_lagoons_54796bdd89.jpg","hash":"peace_lagoons_54796bdd89","name":"peace lagoons.jpg"},"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"id":12453,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/peace_lagoons_54796bdd89.jpg","hash":"peace_lagoons_54796bdd89","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"peace lagoons.jpg","size":7443.75,"width":3000,"height":4056,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/peace_lagoons_54796bdd89.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/thumbnail_peace_lagoons_54796bdd89.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_peace_lagoons_54796bdd89","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_peace lagoons.jpg","path":null,"size":4.83,"width":115,"height":156}},"provider":"aws-s3","createdAt":"2024-06-21T15:37:24.261Z","updatedAt":"2024-06-21T15:37:24.261Z","folderPath":"/","previewUrl":null,"__ggfxIndex":0,"alternativeText":null,"provider_metadata":null},{"id":12453,"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/peace_lagoons_54796bdd89.jpg","hash":"peace_lagoons_54796bdd89","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"peace lagoons.jpg","size":7443.75,"width":3000,"height":4056,"srcUrl":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/peace_lagoons_54796bdd89.jpg","caption":null,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".jpg","url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/thumbnail_peace_lagoons_54796bdd89.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_peace_lagoons_54796bdd89","mime":"image/jpeg","name":"thumbnail_peace lagoons.jpg","path":null,"size":4.83,"width":115,"height":156}},"provider":"aws-s3","createdAt":"2024-06-21T15:37:24.261Z","updatedA